    <briefdescription>
<para>RAII wrapper for OpenSSL <ref refid="raii__wrappers_8h_1af3fabae1c9af50b9312cdff41e11d1dd" kindref="member">BIO</ref> (Bio Input/Output). </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Automatically frees the <ref refid="raii__wrappers_8h_1af3fabae1c9af50b9312cdff41e11d1dd" kindref="member">BIO</ref> on destruction via BIO_free. Supports move semantics for exception-safe code.</para>
<para>Exception-safe: destructor is noexcept.</para>
<para>Example: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><ref refid="classthemis_1_1llm_1_1_scoped_b_i_o_1abc60b540768b2939fab349b0fce4be4b" kindref="member">ScopedBIO</ref><sp/>bio(BIO_new_mem_buf(data,<sp/>size));</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">if</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>(!bio)<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">throw</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>std::runtime_error(</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;Failed<sp/>to<sp/>create<sp/>BIO&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Use<sp/>bio.get()<sp/>to<sp/>access<sp/>BIO*</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}<sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>BIO_free()<sp/>automatically<sp/>called<sp/>here</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
